>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. APPOINTMENT-BACKUP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "appointment-status.cpy".
01 WS-LIVE-PATH             PIC X(256).
01 WS-BACKUP-PATH           PIC X(256).
01 WS-SAFETY-PATH           PIC X(256).
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-OPERATION            PIC X(12).
COPY "appointment-config.cpy".
01 LK-STATUS               PIC 9(3).
01 LK-MESSAGE              PIC X(160).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-OPERATION APPOINTMENT-CONFIG LK-STATUS LK-MESSAGE.
    MOVE APPT-OK TO LK-STATUS
    INITIALIZE LK-MESSAGE
    MOVE AC-DATA-FILE TO WS-LIVE-PATH
    MOVE AC-BACKUP-FILE TO WS-BACKUP-PATH
    MOVE AC-SAFETY-FILE TO WS-SAFETY-PATH
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(LK-OPERATION)
      WHEN "BACKUP"
        CALL "appt_db_backup" USING WS-LIVE-PATH WS-BACKUP-PATH
          LK-STATUS LK-MESSAGE
      WHEN "SNAPSHOT"
        CALL "appt_db_backup" USING WS-LIVE-PATH WS-SAFETY-PATH
          LK-STATUS LK-MESSAGE
      WHEN "RESTORE"
        CALL "appt_db_restore" USING WS-BACKUP-PATH WS-LIVE-PATH
          LK-STATUS LK-MESSAGE
      WHEN OTHER
        MOVE APPT-INVALID-REQUEST TO LK-STATUS
        MOVE "Unknown backup operation" TO LK-MESSAGE
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM APPOINTMENT-BACKUP.
